        "subject": "LU-20879 target: filter OUT update protocol for MDS",
        "message": "LU-20879 target: filter OUT update protocol for MDS\n\nCheck that OUT RPCs are only on connections from an MDS to ensure the\nOUT protocol does not need to be supported across a large number of\nreleases for interoperability.  Issue found during testing of\nLU-20879 patches.\n\nAdd sanity.sh test_435 to confirm.\n\nLustre-change: https://review.whamcloud.com/69467\nLustre-commit: TBD\n\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-4.8 ltvm,llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: Icf9bac7011e9e520839f2f28e8908bb1123ebbe5\n"
